Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Application Standards|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Web Proxy Demo
Priority: 4
	Given Page add
		|pageName|Web Proxy Page|
		|sitePageType|1 Column|
	When Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Web Proxy|
	And Portlet goto Portlet Options
		|portletOption|Configuration|
	And WebProxy add CP
		|initialURL|http://images.google.com/|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Web Proxy Page|
	And AssertTextPresent the value 'Google Images' at locator 'Portlet#H2_HEADER'
##########################################################
The Poshi take-screenshot element is not supported in the readable syntax. Please update this test.
##########################################################
	Then SikuliAssertElementPresent at locator 'WebProxy#SCREENSHOTS_GOOGLE_IMAGES_PNG'